phabet/Google. If you haven't already, [please reach out to your representatives](https://keepandroidopen.org/#consumers) about this issue. For more updates and background information, visit https://keepandroidopen.org/.\r\n\r\n### Improved\r\n- Add UI options to import/export subsciptions in backup & restore settings #13347\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n- Fix NullPointerException in enqueue actions by using Application Context #13385\r\n- [YouTube] Fix parsing duration of related items #13403 TeamNewPipe/NewPipeExtractor#1464\r\n\r\n### Translation & Localization\r\n- Updated translations and removed untranslated locales #13382\r\n\r\n### Development\r\n- Small improvements to Image handling #13207\r\n- Remove freedroidwarn license #13305\r\n- Port path related changes from refactor #13352\r\n- Update dependencies and Gradle to latest stable release #13363\r\n\r\n### NewPipe Extractor\r\n\r\nThis release is shipped with [NewPipe Extractor v0.26.1](https://github.com/TeamNewPipe/NewPipeExtractor/releases/tag/v0.26.1). For additional extractor related changes see the linked release.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe/releases/297269457/reactions","total_count":132,"+1":69,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":16,"confused":0,"heart":20,"rocket":12,"eyes":15}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe/releases/281453060","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe/releases/281453060/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe/releases/281453060/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe/releases/tag/v0.28.4","id":281453060,"author":{"login":"TobiGr","id":17365767,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzY1NzY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17365767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TobiGr","html_url":"https://github.com/TobiGr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TobiGr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/